    <string name="skiptab_guide_step1">① Tap \"Keep Alive\" to allow ignoring battery optimizations;\n</string>
    <string name="skiptab_guide_xiaomi">② Settings → App settings → Permissions → Autostart → enable autostart for TiaoYiTiao, and set the battery policy to \"No restrictions\".</string>
    <string name="skiptab_guide_huawei">② Phone Manager → App launch → TiaoYiTiao → manage manually; allow auto-launch, secondary launch, and background activity.</string>
    <string name="skiptab_guide_oppo">② Settings → Battery → App battery management → TiaoYiTiao → allow background activity; Settings → App management → Autostart → allow autostart.</string>
    <string name="skiptab_guide_oneplus">② China ROM (ColorOS): Settings → Battery → App battery management → allow background activity; global ROMs usually need no setup.</string>
    <string name="skiptab_guide_vivo">② iManager → App management → allow TiaoYiTiao to autostart; Settings → Battery → background power management → allow high background power usage.</string>
    <string name="skiptab_guide_native">Your phone runs near-stock Android — one authorization is enough, no extra setup needed.</string>
    <string name="skiptab_guide_default">② In system settings, enable autostart for TiaoYiTiao and set the battery/power-saving policy to unrestricted.</string>
